  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Behaviour Change Communications -Delivering Accelerated Family Planning in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Behaviour Change Communication (BCC) component identifies and addresses social and cultural barriers to using modern contraceptives. It will deliver evidence-based, tailored messages to increase demand for modern contraception. Implementing partner: M&amp;C Saatchi.</narrative>
  </description>
